# Backend service account: everything under orion/
user orion-backend
topic readwrite orion/#

# Every gateway logs in with username = its gateway id and may only touch its own subtree.
pattern write orion/+/%u/status
pattern write orion/+/%u/heartbeat
pattern write orion/+/%u/telemetry
pattern write orion/+/%u/actuators
pattern write orion/+/%u/event
pattern write orion/+/%u/gsm
pattern write orion/+/%u/cmd_ack
pattern read orion/+/%u/cmd
